{"552520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Far Cry® 5", "steam_appid": 552520, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "dlc": [763820, 761820, 761821, 823990, 874610], "detailed_description": "<h1>Edition Comparison</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/63f35fd3ff2443f53ed6d4e5fd3a2d30.avif?t=1785365694\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><br><h1>Gold Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/575e6987190d8b7d7a00ef0380d0a267.avif?t=1785365694\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br><br>The Gold Edition features all Deluxe Edition content, plus the season pass, which includes Far Cry® 3. Far Cry® 3 available May 29th with the Far Cry 5 Season Pass.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Liberate Hope County from a fanatical doomsday cult led by Joseph Seed and his family in this open world first-person shooter set in the heart of Montana.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLOSIVE AND VISCERAL COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.poster.avif?t=1785365694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.webm?t=1785365694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.mp4?t=1785365694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight against the cult using a massive lethal arsenal or deadly stealth takedowns. From signature melee shovels to heavy rocket launchers, use every tool at your disposal to dismantle Eden’s Gate in bloody combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A DYNAMIC OPEN WORLD</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.poster.avif?t=1785365694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.webm?t=1785365694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.mp4?t=1785365694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the vast Big Sky Country by land, air, and water. Pilot planes for aerial dogfights, drift through farmlands in iconic muscle cars or ATVs. The world reacts to your every move as you liberate Hope County your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECRUIT YOUR SQUAD</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.poster.avif?t=1785365694\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.webm?t=1785365694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.mp4?t=1785365694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never fight alone. Recruit Guns for Hire, specialized rebels for tactical support, or Fangs for Hire like Boomer the dog and Cheeseburger the bear to scout, distract, and maul enemy squads.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE FULL CAMPAIGN IN CO-OP</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/76dd23be509b0febabd262021b90f5c5.poster.avif?t=1785365694\" 